ROX-Filer 2.12 GTK3 - ROX Desktop r39 - 2026-07-29
---------------------------------------------------------

- File associations now use GIO and the Freedesktop XDG standard exclusively.
  The user default is read from `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/mimeapps.list`, normally
  `~/.config/mimeapps.list`, with the normal system XDG fallbacks.
- ROX no longer reads or writes its private `MIME-types` associations under
  `~/.config/rox.sourceforge.net` or `/root/Choices`.
- “Set Default Application...” now opens the standard GTK application chooser
  and writes the selected default through `g_app_info_set_as_default_for_type`.
- Desktop launchers, files and drive icons now share one collision model.
  The actual drive-box rectangle is reserved in whichever corner it occupies,
  and desktop items that overlap it are moved to the next free grid cell.
- Saved duplicate or invalid positions are repaired automatically without
  resetting valid manually placed icons.
- Delayed work-area refreshes were restored for system startup and after wbar
  restarts, so panel margins and drive positions settle correctly.
- Added Ctrl+click multiple selection for desktop files and launchers.
- Desktop labels now use a translucent dark backing and text shadow for
  readability on both light and dark wallpapers.
- The internal Close toolbar item beside Partitions is removed from the actual
  source and toolbar list; only the window-frame close control remains.
- Added translations for the new XDG default-application interface in Arabic,
  Catalan, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Hungarian, Japanese,
  Russian, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese.

